msgstr "需要鐵器時代。"

msgid "Requires a completed Barracks and Bronze Age."
msgstr "需要青銅時代與一棟已完工兵營。"

msgid "Advance to Iron Age. Unlock Iron Swordsmen and the Forge."
msgstr "進入鐵器時代，解鎖鐵刃步兵與鍛造所。"

msgid "Unlock Iron Swordsmen and the Forge."
msgstr "解鎖鐵刃步兵與鍛造所。"

msgid "Improve the weapons of Spearmen and Iron Swordsmen."
msgstr "改良長矛兵與鐵刃步兵的兵器。"

msgid "Spearmen and Iron Swordsmen gain +2 hack damage. Applies to existing and future units."
msgstr "長矛兵與鐵刃步兵的劈砍傷害增加 2，現有與未來單位皆有效。"

msgid "Iron Age research cancelled: a completed Barracks is required. Resources refunded."
msgstr "鐵器時代研究已取消：需要已完工兵營，資源已退還。"

msgid "Cannot build: select a suitable worker and meet the age requirements."
msgstr "無法建造：請選擇合適工人並滿足時代條件。"

msgid "Units occupy the building site. Move them away first."
msgstr "建造位置有單位佔用，請先移開。"

msgid "Frontier Worker: Gather resources, construct and repair buildings."
msgstr "拓荒工人：採集資源、建造及維修建築。"

msgid "Spearman: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "長矛兵：戰鬥單位，不能採集或建造。"

msgid "Slinger: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "投石兵：遠程戰鬥單位，不能採集或建造。"

msgid "Iron Swordsman: Combat unit. Cannot gather or build."
msgstr "鐵刃步兵：鐵器時代步兵，不能採集或建造。"
